get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/privacy
}

docs {
  Current consents, any open deletion request, and anything holding one up.

  `blockers` is shown **before** the person asks to be deleted, not after. An
  order in flight should be something they find out about on the button, not
  in an email a fortnight later saying their deletion is on hold.
}
